  "evidence": [
    "Original air_power5678C0..56A89E and spot_all5B6260..5B8AE2 contain3711/3124 instructions and direct game-service calls. Current mapped dispatchers emit278/379 instructions; much of their logic is compiled into recovery-only helpers with no original function identity. Current source and qualified COFF/pin reports establish a real body-boundary discrepancy, not missing total source coverage or a proven algorithm defect.",
    "Reassemble the full two algorithms as genuine typed C++ inside their existing mapped bodies, including every current path and effect. Remove recovery-only helper/adapter/context scaffolding only after proving no other product caller needs it and preserving useful pin discoveries beside the actual code. Existing real mapped callees remain calls; do not inline genuine original functions or add fake annotations to recovery helpers. No layout, public API, header, global or other mapped body change is authorized without a fresh root scope decision.",
    "Preserve helper-local lifetime/control semantics during reassembly: callback/global rereads, source snapshots, all returns and per-call continuation behavior, nested-loop continue/break destinations, original uninitialized/error/overflow paths and source-owned reference targets. Use meaningful source variables/control flow, no register/stack-slot transcription, assembly, fixed addresses, force-inline, compiler flags or new wrappers. Do not silently normalize bug paths.",
    "Existing host behavioral and compiled-damage coverage must continue to test CURRENT actual source. Adapt helper extraction to actual mapped-body fragments or execute the complete source body with service doubles; a copied old helper fixture is not recovery proof. Add full-body boundary/identity/history continuity and differential effect-trace controls where possible, keeping original pin evidence independent. Product and tests are edited in separate coordinator-prepared checkouts and root integrates them; no shared worker source edits.",
    "Standing user authority: complete compiling bug-for-bug semantic coverage first, original byte-exact milestone thereafter; evidence-backed structural changes acted on immediately. Preserve all historical obligations and do not grant/demote claims by hand. This is coordinator-reviewed manual recovery, not native automatic acceptance.",
    "Root owns task metadata, source annotation publication, Git, resource leases, preparation, native compilation, integration and cleanup. Workers edit only specifically assigned files in isolated checkouts; no Wine/Git/package or master mutations. Return cross-owner discoveries before changing extra scope. Preserve all WIP and do not discard difficult algorithms or unrelated work.",
    "At most3 candidate compiler invocations per affected original per unchanged context, including compile errors. Initially one whole candidate source form; no spelling roulette, unchanged old profile/pointer-binding trials or byte-score-driven semantic regression. Root can preserve a justified structural migration with explicit matching obligations, never weaken an unknown into a pass.",
    "Require independent actual-source/pin review, fresh build/link and source/mapping/reference/claim checks, relevant host and compiling-damage controls, known exact/strict identity continuity, physical outside-scope comparison, then fresh serial destination verification. Baseline1a5f2853f and original image remain immutable; no reset to current working state. Missing full linked retention/allocation, structure/runtime/game and autonomous acceptance proofs remain explicit."
  ],
  "intent": "Restore the complete air_power and spot_all algorithms to their mapped original function bodies",
